WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.464
Goal-conditioned reinforcement learning usually
hands the agent the exact goal,

00:00:05.544 --> 00:00:06.727
as a target image.

00:00:06.807 --> 00:00:11.359
But in the real world you rarely know the precise
goal in advance.

00:00:11.439 --> 00:00:16.974
Ask a robot to close a drawer, and you may not know
how the closed drawer looks.

00:00:17.054 --> 00:00:19.500
We want to specify tasks by analogy.
